    "detailed_description": "Bernband is a sci-fi exploration sim set in a bustling alien metropolis. Wander the streets at your leisure. See the sights, from dodgy dive bars to sprawling mega-marts. Discover secret areas, or hang out with the locals! There are no missions or timers; your only goal is to take a stroll.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/38059e740541edcdbdc278790cc85e94.poster.avif?t=1749416796\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/38059e740541edcdbdc278790cc85e94.webm?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/38059e740541edcdbdc278790cc85e94.mp4?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bernband is a remake of a small game I released for free back in 2014 also called Bernband. A lot of people liked it so I decided to return to the world and see what I could do with a full size game. <br><br>Please enjoy :)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/f3b09122a8983ee444de54400e8c60db.poster.avif?t=1749416796\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/f3b09122a8983ee444de54400e8c60db.webm?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/f3b09122a8983ee444de54400e8c60db.mp4?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features</strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Waddle around \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <br></li><li> Discover secret areas \ud83d\udd0d <br></li><li> Slap stuff \ud83e\udef2 <br></li><li> Get lost \u2049\ufe0f <br></li><li> See the sights \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <br></li><li> Aliens \ud83d\udc7d </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Bernband is a sci-fi exploration sim set in a bustling alien metropolis. Wander the streets at your leisure. See the sights, from dodgy dive bars to sprawling mega-marts. Discover secret areas, or hang out with the locals! There are no missions or timers; your only goal is to take a stroll.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/38059e740541edcdbdc278790cc85e94.poster.avif?t=1749416796\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/38059e740541edcdbdc278790cc85e94.webm?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/38059e740541edcdbdc278790cc85e94.mp4?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bernband is a remake of a small game I released for free back in 2014 also called Bernband. A lot of people liked it so I decided to return to the world and see what I could do with a full size game. <br><br>Please enjoy :)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/f3b09122a8983ee444de54400e8c60db.poster.avif?t=1749416796\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/f3b09122a8983ee444de54400e8c60db.webm?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789170/extras/f3b09122a8983ee444de54400e8c60db.mp4?t=1749416796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features</strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Waddle around \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <br></li><li> Discover secret areas \ud83d\udd0d <br></li><li> Slap stuff \ud83e\udef2 <br></li><li> Get lost \u2049\ufe0f <br></li><li> See the sights \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <br></li><li> Aliens \ud83d\udc7d </li></ul>",
